msgstr "កម្មវិធី​ជា​ច្រើន​ជួយ​អ្នក​ជាមួយ​​គណិត​វិទ្យា និង​ធរណីមាត្រ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbruch;"
msgstr "Kbruch"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An application with several exercise types in order to enhance your calculating "
"with fractions. Different tasks include exercises to find the sum of two "
"fractions, the conversion of fractions into the respective decimal, the "
"comparison (with less than, more than) of fractions, and more."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink "
"url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kbruch\">http://edu.kde.org/kbruch</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kbruch\">"
"http://edu.kde.org/kbruch</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kbruch; Handbook"
msgstr "សៀវភៅ​ដៃ Kbruch"

#. Tag: term
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig;"
msgstr "&kig;"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A great application with interactive geometry. Ideal for teachers attempting to "
"draw a graph on the computer, or students who wish to find out more and "
"investigate with graphs and curves. Currently many things are supported, and "
"you can very easily construct several things from parabolas and hyperbolas, to "
"ellipses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Website: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig\">http://edu.kde.org/kig</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ ៖ <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/kig\">"
"http://edu.kde.org/kig</ulink>"

#. Tag: ulink
#: kde-edutainment.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kig; Handbook"
